Third-party notices — AIGC Studio ComfyUI engines

SMF Works reimplemented the queue, prompt, poll, download, and lane-free behavior
of the community tools below as Python adapters inside AIGC Studio
(`studio/app/adapters/comfy_client.py`, `comfy_qwen.py`, `comfy_h3.py`).
This repository does not ship those Node plugins, a dsh or cordis plugin tree,
or DeepSeek-Harness product branding.

The upstream projects are unofficial community tools. SMF Works does not claim
endorsement by DeepSeek. SMF Works does not own MiniMax, Qwen, or ComfyUI.

